  'a0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000120', 'Mestia - Koruldi Lakes - Becho', '',
  'A 22.9 km route from Mestia to Chokhuldi. Total ascent about 1,839 m and descent about 1,697 m; the highest point is about 2,934 m above sea level. Along the way: St.Elias Church, Khergiani Tower, Fusdi Church, Holy Lake, Koruldi Lake, Koruldi Lakes.',
