  '2668cbcb-6cfe-501a-a95a-0686679dd67f', 'Tanie Trail', NULL,
  'A 14.7 km route starting near Ukankhadu. Total ascent about 1,102 m and descent about 1,072 m; the highest point is about 3,044 m above sea level. Along the way: Tanie Upper Tourist Shelter, Tanie Lake, Tanie Lower Tourist Shelter.',
