  '1b2d0b6b-c0c4-5f46-809e-3ef5e60603e1', 'Zeskho - Ghebi', 'ზესხო - ღები',
  'A 41.4 km route from Zeskho to Ghebi. Total ascent about 1,829 m and descent about 2,280 m; the highest point is about 2,904 m above sea level. Along the way: Lapuri, Vatsistsveri, Goribolo, Sasvano, Matskhovari Church.',
