  '49b15a08-d430-5356-8287-d5d98c8cf6e8', 'Bakurkhevi-Pkhituri-Chirdili trail', 'ბაკურხევი-ფხიტური-ჩირდილის ბილიკი',
  'A 16.3 km route from Bakurkhevi to Korsha. Total ascent about 826 m and descent about 1,372 m; the highest point is about 2,633 m above sea level. Along the way: Sakerpo, Pkhituri Pass, Ukanakho, Buchukurta.',
