  '4539fcc5-97b8-5c5f-98e5-9bdd00a8f2fb', 'Ortskali-Barisakho trail', 'ორწყალი-ბარისახოს ბილიკი',
  'A 20.5 km route from Shuapkho to Barisakho. Total ascent about 1,330 m and descent about 1,319 m; the highest point is about 2,233 m above sea level. Along the way: Tsabaurta, Iremtkalo KopalaSshrine, Kobulo.',
